  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 1603.03 Effect on Other Reporting Requirements. Nothing in He-P 1603 shall be construed as relieving any laboratory from reporting the results of any blood lead analysis to the health care provider that ordered the test, or to any other entity as required by state, federal, or local statutes, rules, or regulations.\n\nSource. #5920, eff 1-1-95; ss by #6096, eff 9-22-95; ss by #7181, eff 12-24-99; amd by #7393, INTERIM, eff 10-28-00, EXPIRED: 4-26-01; ss by #7495, eff 5-23-01; ss by #8039, eff 2-13-04; ss by #8932, eff 7-6-07; ss by #9986, eff 9-1-11, EXPIRED: 9-1-19\n\nNew. #13052, eff 6-11-20; ss by #14230, eff 4-2-25",
